WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.4 · Internal Systems & Operations
The planning and reporting calendar

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Put every planning, reporting and review date on one annual calendar.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from fixed dates: year end, deadlines, board meetings.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Place each review before the decision it informs.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Add your seasons: terms, harvests, festivals, rains.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“March: trustees approve plan and budget. June: trustees approve accounts; the shop company agrees its gift to the charity.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your annual planning and reporting calendar.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
